sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Client as Client App
    participant API as Auth API
    participant RL as Rate Limiter
    participant DB as User DB
    participant Token as SecurityToken Store
    participant Email as Email Service

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over User,Email: Request reset
    User->>Client: Click Forgot Password and enter email
    Client->>API: POST /api/auth/forgot-password
    API->>RL: Check request limit
    RL-->>API: Allowed
    API->>DB: Find user by email
    DB-->>API: User or null
    API->>Token: Create hashed reset token with expiry
    API->>Email: Send reset email with raw token link
    API-->>Client: 200 Generic success message
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over User,Token: Perform reset
    User->>Client: Open reset link and submit new password
    Client->>API: POST /api/auth/reset-password
    API->>Token: Find hashed token
    Token-->>API: Token record
    alt Token invalid or expired
        API-->>Client: 400 Invalid or expired link
    else Token valid
        API->>DB: Update password hash and bump tokenVersion
        API->>Token: Delete reset token(s)
        API-->>Client: 200 Password reset successful
    end
    end
